  "historyNote": "#2234, eff 1-1-83; amd by #2490, eff 10-1-83; amd by #2555, eff 12-23-83; amd by #2930, eff 12-21-84, EXPIRED: 12-21-90 New. #5138, eff 5-6-91; ss by #6504, INTERIM, eff 5-5-97, EXPIRED: 9-2-97; ss by #6566, eff 9-2-97, EXPIRED: 9-2-05 New. #8470, INTERIM, eff 11-1-05, EXPIRED: 4-30-06 New. #8625, eff 5-6-06; ss by #8797, INTERIM, eff 1-12-07, EXPIRED: 7-11-07 New. #8947, eff 7-21-07; renumbered by #10081 (formerly Emp 303.02); ss by #10973, eff 11-12-15; ss by #14578, eff 5-14-26, EXPIRES: 5-14-36",
